          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{4}{6}&=\\frac{36}{54}\\\\\\frac{17}{27}&=\\frac{34}{54}\\end{align*}$$\nSince $34<36$, $\\frac{17}{27}$ is smaller.",
